					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is well-written with believable capsule characterization and the dialogue has that natural flow which is so challenging to do on paper. Or on keyboard, you know what I mean.</p> <p>We need a term for tales that serve as backdoor scp write-ups; stories that describe a new anomaly almost as well as a main-list entry but in a narrative format.</p> 
				 	]]>
